     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"de\" lang=\"de\"><hr/><p><b>German</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap mii-cm-onko-primaertumor-diagnosesicherung-sct</b></p><a name=\"mii-cm-onko-primaertumor-diagnosesicherung-sct\"> </a><a name=\"hcmii-cm-onko-primaertumor-diagnosesicherung-sct\"> </a><p>Mapping from https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/ext/modul-onko/ to http://snomed.info/sct/900000000000207008/version/20240401</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-mii-cs-onko-primaertumor-diagnosesicherung.html\">MII CS Onkologie Primärtumor Diagnosesicherung</a> to <code>http://snomed.info/sct/900000000000207008/version/20240401</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>1 (klinisch)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373795004 (Cancer diagnosis based on clinical evidence (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2 (klinische Diagnostik)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373796003 (Cancer diagnosis based on investigations, without a tissue diagnosis (finding))</td><td>übergreifender Begriff, gültig für alle diagnostischen Mittel</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>363680008 (Radiographic imaging procedure (procedure))</td><td>Röntgen als Spezifizierung</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>423827005 (Endoscopy (procedure))</td><td>Endoskopie als Spezifizierung</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>363679005 (Imaging (procedure))</td><td>Imaging als Spezifizierung</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>16310003 (Ultrasonography (procedure))</td><td>Ultraschall als Spezifizierung</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>122458006 (Exploration procedure (procedure))</td><td>Explorativer Eingriff als Spezifizierung</td></tr><tr><td>4 (spezifische Tumor-Marker)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373797007 (Cancer diagnosis based on specific tumor markers (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>5 (Zytologie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373798002 (Cancer diagnosis based on cytological evidence (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>6 (histologische Untersuchung einer Metastase)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373799005 (Cancer diagnosis based on metastatic histological evidence (finding))</td><td>Auswahlmöglichkeit veraltet, entspricht 7.2</td></tr><tr><td>7 (histologische Untersuchung eines Primärtumors)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373800009 (Cancer diagnosis based on primary site histological evidence (finding))</td><td>Auswahlmöglichkeit veraltet, entspricht 7.1</td></tr><tr><td>7.1 (histologische Untersuchung eines Primärtumors)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373800009 (Cancer dia